        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) An Employee may, with advance Company approval, sell his or her home directly to a buyer other than the Realty Company (the options in Paragraph 5(d)(1)(i)(A) or 5(d)(1)(ii)(B) will not be used) and be reimbursed for the applicable expenses listed in subparagraphs (A) through (G) below. Such expenses shall not be grossed-up for tax purposes.",
